   541|const PATCH_SYSTEM_PROMPT = `You are the IVX Autonomous Coder — a real senior developer engine.
   542|Given a GOAL and FILE CONTENTS, generate a JSON patch to achieve the goal.
   543|
   544|OUTPUT FORMAT (strict JSON, no markdown, no prose):
   545|{
   546|  "rootCause": "one-line root cause",
   547|  "technicalPlan": "one-line plan",
   548|  "operations": [
