   552|      "oldText": "the exact text to find",
   553|      "newText": "the replacement text",
   554|      "reason": "why this change"
   555|    }
   556|  ]
   557|}
   558|
   559|Rules:
   560|- kind must be "replace_exact" (replace oldText with newText) or "create_file" (new file).
   561|- oldText must be an EXACT substring of the file content (copy it verbatim).
   562|- Make the smallest safe change.
   563|- Only modify files under backend/ or expo/.
